      <div class="text-center">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-navy-800 text-white rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold mx-auto mb-4">3</div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-navy-800 mb-2">Download your PDF bundle — $24.99</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Review your completed documents, pay $24.99, and download your 6-page PDF bundle instantly. Print and file with the county recorder the same day.</p>
