      <div class="lg:col-span-2 bg-navy-800 text-white rounded-2xl p-8">
        <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-4">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold">Mechanics Lien Bundle</h3>
            <p class="text-navy-300 text-sm mt-1">Michigan · California · Texas</p>
          </div>
          <div class="text-right">
            <p class="text-4xl font-bold">$24.99</p>
            <p class="text-navy-300 text-sm">one-time</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-navy-200 mb-6">Everything you need to file your mechanics lien — correct statute, correct form, correct deadline.</p>
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2 mb-6">
